metry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploggrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploghttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetricgrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetrichttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Fix `AddAttributes`, `SetAttributes`, `SetBody` on `Record` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log` to not mutate input. (#7403)\\n\\n- Do not double record measurements of `RecordSet` methods in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0`. (#7655)\\n\\n- Do not double record measurements of `RecordSet` methods in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.36.0`. (#7656)\\n\\n### Removed\\n\\n- Drop support for [Go 1.23]. (#7274)\\n\\n- Remove the `FilterProcessor` interface in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`. The `Enabled` method has been added to the `Processor` interface instead. All `Processor` implementations must now implement the `Enabled` method. Custom processors that do not filter records can implement `Enabled` to return `true`. (#7639)\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-REL-01]\\n\\n# Release: v1.39.0 — Release v1.39.0/v0.61.0/v0.15.0/v0.0.14\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/releases/tag/v1.39.0  \\n\\n**Author**: MrAlias  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-12-08T16:32:32Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-08T16:45:46Z  \\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploggrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploghttp 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlpmetr otlpmetricgrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlpmetr otlpmetrichttp 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracegrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracehttp 7372 fix addattribut setattribut setbodi on record in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log to not mutat input 7403 do not doubl record measur of recordset method in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 37 0 7655 do not doubl record measur of recordset method in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 360 7656 remov drop support for go 123 7274 remov the filterprocessor interfac in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log the enabl method ha been ad to the processor interfac instead all processor implement must now implement the enabl method custom processor that do not filter record can implement enabl to return true 7639 sourc id src rel 01 releas v1 39 0 releas v1 39 0 v0 61 0 v0 15 0 v0 0 14 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go releas tag v1 39 0 author mralia creat 2025 12 08t16 32 32z updat 2025 12 08t16 45 46z\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"2b3a16f34fc9921d\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.41022021905975226, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2664015815139318, \"vector_similarity\": 0.74579704, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"* Support custom error type semantics by @MrAlias in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7442\\n\\n* fix(deps): update build-tools to v0.28.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7455\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 to v5.16.3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7456\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/bombsimon/wsl/v5 to v5.3.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7457\\n\\n* sdk/trace: trace id high 64 bit tests by @mahendrabishnoi2 in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7212\\n\\n* Add the `internal/observ` package to `otlptracegrpc` by @MrAlias in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7404\\n\\n* fix(deps): update googleapis to 65f7160 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7460\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module go.opentelemetry.io/collector/featuregate to v1.43.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7461\\n\\n* fix(deps): update module google.golang.org/grpc to v1.76.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7463\\n\\n* fix(deps): update module go.opentelemetry.io/collector/pdata to v1.43.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7462\\n\\n* Use sync.Map and atomics to improve sum performance by @dashpole in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7427\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/stretchr/objx to v0.5.3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7464\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/prometheus/common to v0.67.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7465\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"support custom error type semant by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7442 fix dep updat build tool to v0 28 1 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7455 chore dep updat modul github com go git go git v5 to v5 16 3 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7456 chore dep updat modul github com bombsimon wsl v5 to v5 3 0 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7457 sdk trace trace id high 64 bit test by mahendrabishnoi2 in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7212 add the intern observ packag to otlptracegrpc by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7404 fix dep updat googleapi to 65f7160 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7460 chore dep updat modul go opentelemetri io collector featureg to v1 43 0 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7461 fix dep updat modul googl golang org grpc to v1 76 0 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7463 fix dep updat modul go opentelemetri io collector pdata to v1 43 0 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7462 use sync map and atom to improv sum perform by dashpol in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7427 chore dep updat modul github com stretchr objx to v0 53 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7464 chore dep updat modul github com prometheus common to v0 67 1 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7465\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"843222abe76915f8\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.4095495270597522, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2664015815139318, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7435614, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Add experimental observability metrics in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploghttp`. (#7512)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics for manual reader in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7524)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics for periodic reader in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7571)\\n\\n- Support `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_LOGS_INSECURE` and `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_INSECURE` environmental variables in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploghttp`. (#7608)\\n\\n- Add `Enabled` method to the `Processor` interface in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`. All `Processor` implementations now include an `Enabled` method. (#7639)\\n\\n- The `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.38.0` package. The package contains semantic conventions from the `v1.38.0` version of the OpenTelemetry Semantic Conventions. See the [migration documentation](./semconv/v1.38.0/MIGRATION.md) for information on how to upgrade from `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0.`(#7648)\\n\\n### Changed\\n\\n- `Distinct` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute` is no longer guaranteed to uniquely identify an attribute set. Collisions between `Distinct` values for different Sets are possible with extremely high cardinality (billions of series per instrument), but are highly unlikely. (#7175)\\n\\n- `WithInstrumentationAttributes` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace` synchronously de-duplicates the passed attributes instead of delegating it to the returned `TracerOption`. (#7266)\\n\\n- `WithInstrumentationAttributes` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/meter` synchronously de-duplicates the passed attributes instead of delegating it to the returned `MeterOption`. (#7266)\\n\\n- `WithInstrumentationAttributes` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/log` synchronously de-duplicates the passed attributes instead of delegating it to the returned `LoggerOption`. (#7266)\\n\\n- Rename the `OTEL_GO_X_SELF_OBSERVABILITY` environment variable to `OTEL_GO_X_OBSERVABILITY` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`, and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/stdout/stdouttrace`. (#7302)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"add experiment observ metric in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploghttp 7512 add experiment observ metric for manual reader in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7524 add experiment observ metric for period reader in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7571 support otel _ export _ otlp _ log _ insecur and otel _ export _ otlp _ insecur environment variabl in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploghttp 7608 add enabl method to the processor interfac in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log all processor implement now includ an enabl method 7639 the go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 38 0 packag the packag contain semant convent from the v1 38 0 version of the opentelemetri semant convent see the migrat document semconv v1 38 0 migrat md for inform on how to upgrad from go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 37 0 7648 chang distinct in go opentelemetri io otel attribut is no longer guarante to uniqu identifi an attribut set collis between distinct valu for differ set are possibl with extrem high cardin billion of seri per instrument but are high unlik 7175 withinstrumentationattribut in go opentelemetri io otel trace synchron de duplic the pass attribut instead of deleg it to the return traceropt 7266 withinstrumentationattribut in go opentelemetri io otel meter synchron de duplic the pass attribut instead of deleg it to the return meteropt 7266 withinstrumentationattribut in go opentelemetri io otel log synchron de duplic the pass attribut instead of deleg it to the return loggeropt 7266 renam the otel _ go _ x _ self _ observ environ variabl to otel _ go _ x _ observ in go opentelemetri io otel sdk trace go opentelemetri io otel sdk log and go opentelemetri io otel export stdout stdouttrac 7302\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"6a08b40f9cb6a8a6\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3825810221337733, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.22440733447681901, \"vector_similarity\": 0.75165296, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"docu