erged (2025-10-07T13:40:23Z)  \\n\\n**Branch**: `optimize_counter_syncmap` → `main`  \\n\\n**Changes**: +437 / -121 across 14 files  \\n\\n**Labels**: area:metrics  \\n\\n**Milestone**: v1.39.0\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Review Comments (18)\\n\\n**MrAlias** on `CHANGELOG.md` — 2025-10-02T17:55:27Z\\n\\n```suggestion\\n\\n- Improve performance of concurrent measurements in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7427)\\n\\n```\\n\\n**MrAlias** on `sdk/metric/internal/aggregate/aggregate.go` — 2025-10-03T00:03:10Z\\n\\nPassing the temporality only to then parse it below and make a decision here seems like a bad smell. I'm more inclined to refactoring the Sum in some way to better address this and remove the control param being passed here.\\n\\n**MrAlias** on `sdk/metric/internal/aggregate/sum.go` — 2025-10-03T15:10:13Z\\n\\nA pre-increment approach with rollback may address this.\\n\\n```suggestion\\n\\n\\t\\t// Pre-increment, reserve a slot first.\\n\\n\\t\\tnewLen := s.len[hotIdx].Add(1)\\n\\n\\t\\tif s.aggLimit > 0 && newLen >= int64(s.aggLimit) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t// We exceeded the limit, decrement back and use overflow\\n\\n\\t\\t\\ts.len[hotIdx].Add(-1)\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tfltrAttr = overflowSet\\n\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\n```\\n\\n**MrAlias** on `sdk/metric/internal/aggregate/sum.go` — 2025-10-03T15:14:24Z\\n\\nSplitting this into a type dedicated to cumulative values seems appropriate. It would have fields like this right?\\n\\n```suggestion\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src pr 04 pull request use sync map and atom to improv sum perform open telemetri opentelemetri go 7427 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7427 author dashpol creat 2025 09 29t14 36 56z updat 2025 10 14t14 40 27z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state merg 2025 10 07t13 40 23z branch optim _ counter _ syncmap main chang 437 121 across 14 file label area metric mileston v1 39 0 review comment 18 mralia on changelog md 2025 10 02t17 55 27z suggest improv perform of concurr measur in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7427 mralia on sdk metric intern aggreg aggreg go 2025 10 03t00 03 10z pass the tempor onli to then pars it below and make a decis here seem like a bad smell i m more inclin to refactor the sum in some way to better address this and remov the control param be pass here mralia on sdk metric intern aggreg sum go 2025 10 03t15 10 13z a pre increment approach with rollback may address this suggest pre increment reserv a slot first newlen s len hotidx add 1 if s agglimit 0 newlen int64 s agglimit we exceed the limit decrement back and use overflow s len hotidx add 1 fltrattr overflowset mralia on sdk metric intern aggreg sum go 2025 10 03t15 14 24z split this into a type dedic to cumul valu seem appropri it would have field like this right suggest\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"875c049e8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7427.md\", \"id\": \"4b83ef940640c267\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3767835341337733, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.22440733447681901, \"vector_similarity\": 0.732328, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7427.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"875c049e8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7427.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7427.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 37741, \"chunk_count\": 26, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:02\", \"token_count\": 14705, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}], \"pagination\": {\"page\": 1, \"page_size\": 10, \"total_chunks\": 70, \"total_pages\": 7}, \"query_info\": {\"question\": \"custom temporality selector config