{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"No. The Go SIG explicitly decided against SDK support for custom temporality-selector configuration snippets, directing users to the full OpenTelemetry configuration-file format instead. [SRC-NOTE-03]\n\nHowever, `v1.39.0` did ship predefined selector functions in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`: `DeltaTemporalitySelector`, `CumulativeTemporalitySelector`, and `LowMemoryTemporalitySelector`. [SRC-REL-01]"}}
